id=maxregner
name=Maxregner System
version=2.0.0
versionCode=20
author=maxregner
description=Maxregner navigation (Maxregner Orb), sound scheme, full UI design system recode, extras, performance and security profiles. Ships compiled RRO overlay APKs that Magisk mounts systemlessly over the read-only erofs partitions, plus runtime props (resetprop) and real sound/font/animation assets. Safe by design: overlays use only safe resource overrides (no layout/class swaps), boot scripts never abort on failure.
